</span><br /><br /></td></tr><tr><td valign="top"><span class="textwhite">5. <a class="bcspansubnav" target="_new" href="/TechnologicallyAdvancedGaming">Technologically Advanced Gaming</a><br />If you like to game you can come here, there is a huge selection of games, from FPS's, to RPG's, To Stragedy, to Series.  Come here also if you just want to have a general conversation or hang out in the shoutbox. Please stop by.</span><br /><br /></td></tr><tr><td valign="top"><span class="textwhite">6. <a class="bcspansubnav" target="_new" href="/3MoonsofGorSoapboxCentral">3 Moons of Gor...Soapbox Central</a><br />You must be 18 years old to view or post on this board</span><br /><br /></td></tr><tr><td valign="top"><span class="textwhite">7. <a class="bcspansubnav" target="_new" href="/FortaKonsForums">Forta-Kon's Forums</a><br /></span><br /><br /></td></tr><tr><td valign="top"><span class="textwhite">8. <a class="bcspansubnav" target="_new" href="/Weezerfans">Weezerfans</a><br />Weezer fans unite</span><br /><br /></td></tr><tr><td valign="top"><span class="textwhite">9. <a class="bcspansubnav" target="_new" href="/aceyslade">aceyslade</a><br />Everything Acey Slade and The Murderdolls.</span><br /><br /></td></tr><tr><td valign="top"><span class="textwhite">10. <a class="bcspansubnav" target="_new" href="/DBDOfficialForums">DBD Official Forums!</a><br />This is clan DBD's official forums, they are dedicated to everyone who has an interrest of JK2, Star Wars or fun in general actually. We are one of the largest JK2 clans today, and probobly the Largest 1.02 clan today. So enjoy your stay!</span><br /><br /></td></tr>
