avenShrine">.+. Spellbound - A Raven Shrine .+.</a><br />Talk about Teen Titans...espicially the emotionless gothic goddess, Raven.</span><br /><br /></td></tr><tr><td valign="top"><span class="textwhite">31. <a class="bcspansubnav" target="_new" href="/GeekStuff">.:Geek:.:Stuff:.</a><br />my society is place were geeks and geeks alike can come and chat about what eva they like</span><br /><br /></td></tr><tr><td valign="top"><span class="textwhite">32. <a class="bcspansubnav" target="_new" href="/H00kersClan">.H00kers. Clan</a><br /></span><br /><br /></td></tr><tr><td valign="top"><span class="textwhite">33. <a class="bcspansubnav" target="_new" href="/hacksign">.hack//sign</a><br />Finally, a place where all fans of the .hack series can come and talk all in one place.</span><br /><br /></td></tr><tr><td valign="top"><span class="textwhite">34. <a class="bcspansubnav" target="_new" href="/Jawa">.Jawa.</a><br />JK2 Clan</span><br /><br /></td></tr><tr><td valign="top"><span class="textwhite">35. <a class="bcspansubnav" target="_new" href="/nintendoaddiction">::nintendo|addiction::</a><br />Your one stop source for everything Nintendo!</span><br /><br /></td></tr><tr><td valign="top"><span class="textwhite">36. <a class="bcspansubnav" target="_new" href="/BackStabbers"><|BackStabbers|=</a><br />&lt;|BackStabbers|= Counter-Strike Clan Forum</span><br /><br /></td></tr><tr><td valign="top"><span class="textwhite">37. <a class="bcspansubnav" target="_new" href="/SSSTEELSOLDIERS"><SS> STEEL SOLDIERS</a><br /></span><br /><br /></td></tr><tr><td valign="top"><span class="textwhite">38. <a class="bcspansubnav" target="_new" href="/USTraining"><US>Training</a><br />The Society is For Training Members 

