&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/f
&lt;/center&gt;			</span><br /><br /></td></tr><tr><td valign="top"><span class="textwhite">1713. <a class="bcspansubnav" target="_new" href="/YahooDimes">Yahoo Dimes</a><br /></span><br /><br /></td></tr><tr><td valign="top"><span class="textwhite">1714. <a class="bcspansubnav" target="_new" href="/YamisRealm">Yami's Realm</a><br />If you are reading this, then you must be reeeeally bored. Anyhoo, this is Yami's Realm! You can roleplay, rant, save anvils, shove things up your nose, discuss, and debate! Fun, huh?</span><br /><br /></td></tr><tr><td valign="top"><span class="textwhite">1715. <a class="bcspansubnav" target="_new" href="/YearoftheApocalypse">Year of the Apocalypse</a><br />Enter a world where Man once ruled the lands, but then left to claim the stars.  The old races, once thought of as Myths, now rule then lands and tear down the kingdoms man had once ruled.
Now a new threat has chased man back to earth and they now plead with the old races to aid them in the battle.
